    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When scientists try to create and control magic, their first spell goes wrong, and monsters were accidentally brought to life and destroy cities. Now the military has to hold off and contain the monsters while scientists try to figure out how to undo the spell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The enemies AI can detect the skill of the player and automatically adjust difficulty based on player performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BLACK MAGIC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect magic plants to return to the scientists so they can research it and figure out a new spell. The magic can also heal you, and be used to buy magic grenades and spells you can use in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MULTIPLE COMBAT STYLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a soldier and fight off monsters with guns and grenades or as a magician using a magic sword and spells. Progress through the story mode to discover new spells and unlock magic grenades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PROGRESS THROUGH THE STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock levels in the story mode with black magic points that you can earn in arcade mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the cure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When scientists try to create and control magic, their first spell goes wrong, and monsters were accidentally brought to life and destroy cities. Now the military has to hold off and contain the monsters while scientists try to figure out how to undo the spell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The enemies AI can detect the skill of the player and automatically adjust difficulty based on player performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BLACK MAGIC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect magic plants to return to the scientists so they can research it and figure out a new spell. The magic can also heal you, and be used to buy magic grenades and spells you can use in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MULTIPLE COMBAT STYLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a soldier and fight off monsters with guns and grenades or as a magician using a magic sword and spells. Progress through the story mode to discover new spells and unlock magic grenades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PROGRESS THROUGH THE STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock levels in the story mode with black magic points that you can earn in arcade mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the cure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
